# Roborazzi golden PNGs are committed under each module's tracked
# `src/test/roborazzi/` dir (the `filePath` each `captureRoboImage` writes to),
# so `verifyRoborazziDebug` can compare a fresh render against them in CI. The
# build-dir outputs below are transient verify artifacts (diff / actual /
# compare images) and stay ignored.
**/build/outputs/roborazzi/
**/build/outputs/roborazzi-compare/
